  (text "VTAP_P/N = +2V5/-2V5 (phase RESULT: 12.5 mA per rail, fixed).\n0R links: replace by a DAC-driven stage if a trim turns out to be needed." (at 171.45 190.5 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left top)) (uuid ef18bd03-7109-5494-97ad-45f1368e44b8))
  (text "DAC_TRIG (PA4) and VOFS (PA5) are raw DAC outputs (0.2..2.7 V):\nsumming networks at the TLV3801 (trigger_phase) and at the\nOPA197 servo node (input). DAC1/DAC2 buffered: RL >= 5k, CL <= 50 pF." (at 285.75 116.84 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left top)) (uuid a8bdf60f-45ff-5285-a456-bb3e08566874))
