  (text "NRST 100 nF; BOOT0 low (close JP701 for the\nUSB DFU / USART1 bootloader); LED on PB14, active low." (at 106.68 252.73 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left top)) (uuid 14a49aad-4325-582c-8036-6afa3b61f3c5))
  (text "STM32G474CBT6 pin plan:\n 8 PA0   ADC_IN        ADC12_IN1 (fast channel), sampler output\n 9 PA1   TRIG_SEL      GPIO out (TMUX136 select); moved from PB6 for the layout fan-out\n10 PA2   DAC_TAPTH     OPAMP1_VOUT follower of DAC3_CH1 -> VTAP_TH divider\n11 PA3   NC            spare\n12 PA4   DAC_TRIG      DAC1_OUT1 -> TRIG_LEVEL sum at the TLV3801 (trigger_phase)\n13 PA5   VOFS          DAC1_OUT2 -> Rofs into the OPA197 servo node (input)\n14 PA6   DAC_BIAS_A    DAC2_OUT1 -> VBIAS_A divider to -2V5\n15 PA7   NC            spare\n30 PA8   NC            reserved: OPAMP5_VOUT (DAC4_CH2 follower, spare analog output)\n31 PA9   HOST_TX       USART1_TX (AF7) -> 100R R512 -> J501 pin 4\n32 PA10  HOST_RX       USART1_RX (AF7) <- 100R R511 <- J501 pin 2\n33 PA11  USB_DM        USB FS D-\n34 PA12  USB_DP        USB FS D+ (internal 1.5k pull-up)\n37 PA13  UC_SWDIO      SWDIO -> J501 pin 8\n38 PA14  UC_SWCLK      SWCLK -> J501 pin 10\n39 PA15  I2C_SCL       I2C1_SCL (AF4) -> MS5351M\n 7 PG10  UC_NRST       NRST, 100 nF -> J501 pin 14\n 5 PF0   MCU_CLK       OSC_IN, HSE bypass from MS5351M CLK1\n 6 PF1   DBG1          GPIO (OSC_OUT free in HSE bypass), debug -> J501 pin 12; moved from PB9\n 2 PC13  NC            spare\n 3 PC14  NC            spare\n 4 PC15  NC            spare\n16 PB0   NC            spare\n17 PB1   DAC_BIAS_K    OPAMP3_VOUT follower of DAC3_CH2 -> 4.7k / 5.1k divider -> VBIAS_K\n18 PB2   NC            spare\n40 PB3   SPI_SCK       SPI1_SCK (AF5), master\n41 PB4   SPI_MISO      SPI1_MISO (AF5); UCPD dead-battery pull-down until disabled\n42 PB5   SPI_MOSI      SPI1_MOSI (AF5)\n43 PB6   FPGA_DONE     GPIO in (FPGA DONE); UCPD dead-battery pull-down harmless on an input; moved from PB0\n44 PB7   I2C_SDA       I2C1_SDA (AF4)\n45 PB8   BOOT0         BOOT0: 10k pull-down, JP701 to +3V3 for the bootloader\n46 PB9   SPI_CS        GPIO, SPI chip select (software NSS); moved from PB10\n22 PB10  NC            spare\n25 PB11  ADC_TRIG      TIM2_CH4 (AF1) frame mark to FPGA pin 18; ADC12 triggered internally by TIM2_TRGO (OC4REF)\n26 PB12  NC            reserved: OPAMP4_VOUT (DAC4_CH1 follower, ADC_REF_MID trim option)\n27 PB13  FPGA_RECONFIG GPIO open-drain (FPGA RECONFIG_N); moved from PB2\n28 PB14  LED           status LED D701, active low; moved from PC13\n29 PB15  NC            spare\n20 VREF+ VREFP         VREFBUF 2.9 V output, 1 uF + 100 nF\nHOST_RX/HOST_TX named as on the yanartas sensing board (MCU as host):\nHOST_RX = MCU UART RX, HOST_TX = MCU UART TX." (at 11.43 149.86 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left top)) (uuid cc2bcc02-9e43-5d6a-8da0-9894de2f22ce))
  (label "VDDA" (at 25.4 275.59 0) (fields_autoplaced) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 97982b5d-7361-5269-9649-e5354c2eee8b))
